## These two labels are shown when navigating to a file:// URL while having DevTools opened,
## in order to suggest enabling the Local Mode and load them from https instead.

# Variables:
#   $url (String): The local mode URL
toolbox-local-mode-notice = 这文档能够也是有负载的从“{ $url }”使用 DevTools “本地的模式”, 哪个能是启用在那设置嵌板.

toolbox-local-mode-notice-add-to-settings-button = 添加到设置
toolbox-local-mode-notice-try-it-button = 尝试它
toolbox-local-mode-notice-navigate-to-existing-mapping = 航行到现成的映射
toolbox-local-mode-notice-always-hide = 不要显示我这再一次
